Description: QA171 adds privacy-limited GOFA notification diagnostics to export original notification events and sanitized class/property/key/type metadata only; no traffic payload values, road speed limits, camera alerts or navigation turns are connected or fabricated; preserves persistent on/off and compact handle. Road speed limits/cameras/live route UNVERIFIED; QA162 GOFA-only Speed8 trial (no guessed road limit), plus QA161 scoped first SOLO remote geometry reference 120ms instead of 300ms, preserving media and split safety gates; retains QA160 read-only CarPlay Home trace. Native Home app-grid destination NOT fixed or physically tested. First-party experimental iOS16 rootless CarPlay Native12 integrated candidate with live app cards/recent, logo loading scene, touch activity borders, safer scene resize and foreground-only chrome. Real installed-app picker, source-owned external SBAppViewController host, two visible empty split panes with pass-through input, two clickable controls per pane, scene-ready/failure signals, split/swap/focus/drag and strict disconnect/heartbeat teardown. The CarPlay receiver draws no demo panes or fake action buttons; iPhone shows only actual installed-app inventory and active-session status. No external vendor binary or licensing; actual dual-app rendering and touch on iPhone X/CarPlay not yet device-verified. Opt-in 10-second physical disconnect per-process RunningBoard close with app PID provenance, reconnect cancel and phone foreground guard. Source-verified stage only; CarPlay native map tile/navigation and full iPhone auto-launch or screen-off are not device-verified. Unreleased QA candidate.
